  inspectionId: Kira_Train
  firstInspection:
  - Nobody's getting off. {p}{small}I keep checking.{/small}
  repeatInspection:
  - Every stop is just more tunnel. {p}I hate that I'm used to it.
  - Your mom has your hands. {p}She holds the phone like you hold everything. {small}Too
    tight.{/small}
  - Byte keeps looking at the back of the train. {p}{small}Do you think he knows
    something?{/small}
